      "closed_state_id": "1",
      "google_reviews_json": "{\"place_id\":\"ChIJ4UMEoDTVwkcR9fpDcK9CmXo\",\"rating\":3.7,\"user_rating_count\":152,\"google_maps_uri\":\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=8834165465334151925\",\"fetched_at\":\"2026-11-12T19:33:35+01:00\",\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":1,\"text\":\"Je suis venue chercher un plateau de mignardises sucrées pour un anniversaire (d’une pâtissière en plus…) j’étais rouge de honte…\\nLes pâtisseries n’étaient pas fraîches. Celles composés d’un sablé étaient donc toutes molles, le glaçage des minis éclairs avaient complètement coulé.\\nEt ce n’est malheureusement pas la première fois !\\nEn discutant avec les commerçants de la rue Henri Barbusse, je me suis aperçue que j’étais loin d’être la seule…\\nQuand j’ai fait part de mon mécontentement, on en a carrément eu rien à faire.\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-11-08T20:26:04+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a moins d'une semaine\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Pauline Masquelier\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103069035694956121427/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYYsORoB5izeMrm9JVQSVxuD1yp_7KmHKYA9AjubR0w2o5iw0A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-30T20:57:09+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a une semaine\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Adel Bouzekri\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112121355013369414746/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWM89X6NxaB705c8x4sLLTWiYR5VAXSVjPoNI_S5XCz-s12RnZqCw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-22T15:12:34+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 3 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Marie Hélène Waeytens\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118287556847594266749/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfQS44WzkrnxGfmPLnG1DZi7XgNDTTyzn6j10y_hHopzeVZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-14T05:13:29+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 4 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"NanaBakery59\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110175457881716410972/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUIq4v9BhFVmkxcPktBIwlez7eN6xYk8X0A3apNeecva1UjxH4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":2,\"text\":\"Bonne boulangerie de qualité, cependant la taille des viennoiseries est vraiment ridicule, je me sens totalement arnaquée. Merci de revoir vos proportions afin de vous aligner sur les autres boulangeries et respecter ainsi vos clients .\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-03T10:08:43+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Coralie Doye\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106318044239809479359/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5X_A3fIaaQQ-jr2NPCLBmaio51FehYftsepvZ_Ukn_xMSFw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"}]}",
